    <name>Mantle Rock and the Trail of Tears, 1838–39 (approximate)</name>
    <description>Approximate waypoints for Mantle Rock and the Trail of Tears, 1838–39. Positions are taken from the story notes and are not a survey. https://kyhistorydrive.com/stories/mantle-rock-and-the-trail-of-tears/</description>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Enters Kentucky on the Port Royal Road (Gray's Inn camp)</name>
      <description>near Guthrie. Todd Co., KY. Approximate.</description>
      <Point><coordinates>-87.17,36.64,0</coordinates></Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Hopkinsville camp, rations; burials of Chiefs Whitepath and Fly Smith (Trail of Tears Commemorative Park)</name>
      <description>Hopkinsville. Christian Co., KY. Approximate.</description>
      <Point><coordinates>-87.493,36.857,0</coordinates></Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
